      "en": "\"Those with poor sight can see through it,",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": "Riddle concerns corrective glasses: poor sight becomes clear while normal sight blurs. E0684.evt bytecode confirms Glasses succeeds at choice 3. No answer order or branch changes."
    },
